  "_note": "MAX232 dual RS-232 driver/receiver (DIP-16). Pin table from TI SLLS047. 1 C1+, 2 V+, 3 C1-, 4 C2+, 5 C2-, 6 V-, 7 T2OUT, 8 R2IN, 9 R2OUT, 10 T2IN, 11 T1IN, 12 R1OUT, 13 R1IN, 14 T1OUT, 15 GND, 16 VCC. Engine models the LEVEL story: inverting +/-8 V drivers, TTL receivers with 5 k input load; the data path stays on the UART/ACIA hooks.",
